config BR2_PACKAGE_PYTHON_PYDNSSEC_PROVER
	bool "python-pydnssec-prover"
	help
	  Offline DNSSEC validation of RFC 9102 proofs, in pure Python.

	  This is what lets the signing app check a BIP-353 payment name
	  on the device instead of trusting the coordinator that sent
	  the PSBT.

	  https://github.com/bitsagarob/pydnssec-prover
